=== meta
profile = "geml-style/v1"
title = "codemap graph style"
===

Display-time knobs for `geml-code-graph`. Seeded on first build; edit
freely — build never rewrites this, exactly like `foldings.geml` beside it.
That one tunes BUILD-time folding; this one tunes what you see.

=== style-rule {#graph match="diagram[format=geml-code-graph]" \
                fold=1 depth=6 hide-accessors=true \
                palette="#e3f2fd #e8f5e9 #fff3e0 #f3e5f5 #e0f7fa #fce4ec #f1f8e9 #ede7f6 #fff8e1 #e0f2f1 #efebe9 #f9fbe7"}
===
